<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Natito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa Natito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Natito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Natito</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa Natito phi imoka yo iwarakha ncheshe chaalhepiye ni Napaolo chaarwenhe aya wa ntu mmoka mmoka ahikhalhaka nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. Iwarakha chikina ttaaru phi iwarakha yo upachera wa Natimotheo ni iwarakha yo nayelhi wa Natimotheo ni iwarakha wa Nafilimoni. Napaolo yaalhempe iwarakha u Natito nansho yooniaka wiira aalhakenlhe wiira yashomiye vaattuni. Ninochuwelha yoyo mwaha uyo ukhalhawaya anowiihimiacha ipilhi aya thoko karumiya, ittu Natito yaari aya achuwelhaka. Napaolo veekinaka yaalhempe ilha iwarakha ilha iyaakha iriyari yo 63-65 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Napaolo ahaalhehera Natito wiira avare ntheko wo uholhelha milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo u ichirumba yo Ukirete. Paahi etu Napaolo aalhepa iwarakha ilha waalhehera Natito wiira yaathanlhe ni wettuchiha ahoolhelhi o milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. Anowaalhelha chittu thoko chaalhempe aya u Natimotheo. Nhina iwarakha mmo, anoohimiacha iphiro chinothananiya aya ukhalha ahoolhelhi o milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo chiyo. Paahi etu milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo ni ahoolhelhi o milhoko o lhelho va attwariheke chechiyo iphiro chinothananiya aya ukhalhana chiyo vanoholhelha aya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anowaalhehera Natito waathanlha attu anonttuna Nlhuku (nlhako wo 1:1-16).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anowaalhehera weettuchiha attu akhalhe makhalhelho anothananiya ni Nlhuku (nlhako wo 2:1-3:11).</para>
  <para style="io">Vanomalhiha aya, Napaolo anomalhihera wo malhove o uttuka iwarakha aya iyo (nlhako wo 3:12-15).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Mii Paolo, namitheko a Nlhuku ni karumiya a Yesu Kuristo kinoolhepa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:1">Mii kihothanlhiya ni urumiya kirwee kaahelhe nrima attu athanlhiye ni Nlhuku ni waaholhelha attu achuwelhe ikeekhene wiira akhalhe iphiro chinothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Yeyo ikeekhene iyo phi nonikhulhuvelhiha upatta ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha, waalhehiye ihu ni Nlhuku hinoothacha toka machokholhelho, ilhapo ihinaya wuupiya. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Ni ikatema yoombone yaayeke ahopatakulha nttenga awe. Nkakaarumiya mii wiira kivire kaahimiacha wo ulheheriya ni Nlhuku Moopolhi ihu.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Kinolhepa iwarakha iwe wa inyu Natito, anaaka o ikekhiaye munrimani munopisha ihu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu, ni wa Kuristo Yesu Moopolhi ihu.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntheko u Natito Ukirete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Phi nlhatu etu no uhiyani Ukirete wiira nrehelhelhe vakittu vawukuwilhe, ni waathanlha manyaashulhupalhe akhalhe manyaahoolhelhi o milhoko cha attu anonrumelhelha Kuristo kila iwani. Tho, muupuwelheke thoko chenre aka wo ulheherani. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Wiira, ashulhupalhe ahoolhelhi o nlhoko wa attu anonrumelhelha Kuristo anophwanelhiya ukhalha attu o uhikhuwachiya, akhalheke nlhopwana a nthiyana mmoka ni achishaana awe akhalheke anonrumelhelha Kuristo, ahikhalhe o uhiiwa aamukiaka ama o tiyamaru. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Ukhalhawaya attu anoshunga nlhoko wa attu anonrumelhelha Kuristo phi o ipilhi yo weemelhelha mitheko cha Nlhuku. Paahi etu, hikhalhe ntu o ukhuwachiya ama o wiititihacha, mena hikhalhe ntu o uhipicha uthunalha, ama ntu o uhapalhiya, ama ntu o indewo, ama ntu o nlhulha wo uttuna nchurukhu chinene. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Nansho akhalheke ntu o waapochera alheto ni ntu o uttuna upanga chittu choombone. Akhalheke ntu o wiichaamuka, ntu e ikekhiaye, ntakatifu hinokhuwachiya ni ntu neetawara mwanene. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Akhalheke ntu novarechesha rata nttenga wo ukhulhuvelhiya, thoko chinre awe wo wiittuchihiya wiira oorie waahelha nrima attu wo weettuchiha meettuchiho o ikeekhene ni wookokolha attu anovaanyiha.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Ukhalhawaya ahaawo attu anovaanyiha ni waathepiacha attu akina chittu chihiri ni irusho, athepaka alhe akhumme iphiro cha attu enelhiye unyawo munrimani, Ayahudi anrumelhenlhe Kuristo alhe. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Amaalhihiyeke yayo attu ayo ukhalhawaya naahiyaka anoothepa waapitikusha nrima attu mmanupani mwonkhaye vaneettuchiha aya chittu chihinooria aya wiittuchiha. Anopangacha chiicho wiira apatte nchurukhu wo wiittuchiha chittu cho wulhiha muru. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Ata ntu mmoka mmilhokoni mwa anamilhohi aya, ahoolhumacha wiira, “Attu o Ukirete mahuku onkhaye arii attu o woothacha, ari thoko mashene, attu o ureshi ni attu o nlhulha!” <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Ni uyo hohimiechesha we ikekhiaye. Ni wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, mwaachacheracheke chinene, upisha nrima waya ulhipeke. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Ahiyeke wiiwelhelha ithelhi cha Ayahudi mena ahiiwelhelhe malhehero yeeshiye ni attu akhonte ikeekhene.<verse eid="TIT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Kila ittu iri yorera wa attu orera nansho khiiwo ittu iri yoombone wa attu o nyalha ni o nrima uhinrumelhelha. Ukhalhawaya mirima ni irusho chaya chihonanarihiya. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Yayo attu ayo aneera wiira anonchuwelha Nlhuku, nansho meetelho aya anowaakhota. Phi attu ahinolhoka mmiithoni mwa ashikhunanaya, o mirima cho itiyamaru, ahinolhoka wo mitheko chiriyoothe chorera.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Meettuchiho o Ikekheene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Nansho inyuva mweettuchiheke attu malhove a Nlhuku arii phi e ikeekhene. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Mwaahimerieke ashulhupalhe manyaalhopwana wiira eethimicheke, akhalheke attu o weewelhelha ashikhunanaya, attu o irusho, attu o upisha nrima ni o waattuna attu ni o uvilhelha. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Ni chiichammo mweettuchiheke maniyoopani o wulhuvalha wiira amwooveke Nlhuku. Ahikhalhe attu o waapa akhunanaya ama ipotta cho uhapalhiya utheka. Eettuchiheke iphiro choombone ashikhunanaya, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />wiira aalhake imialhi wiira aattune manyowannyaya ni achishaana aya, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />eetimarikheke ni vavawo ahiinanarihe, akhalheke attu anopangacha chittu choombone wa manyaowannyaya, nlhove na Nlhuku nihiwe naaruwaniya.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Thothoni tho, mwaamukeke ashimirawo wiira ni ayo eethimicheke. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Wo iphiro chonkhaye, ni inyu mwaanene nkhalheke ntu o ulhatiya wo meetelho inyu oombone. Mwiilhipiheke wo malhove nnetuchiha inyu attu, mena nhipange thoko ncheche. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Malhove aneettuchiha inyu attu akhalheke o ikuru, ahinoovanyihiya, amalhaponi inyu awe oona ishoni ahikhalhaka ni ittu yo unanara yo unihukumulha.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Ipotta, ni ayo chiicho eetimarikheke wa manyaapwiiya aya aanaaruma ayo, yaatelhihaka wo mitheko chonkhaye chinopanga aya. Ahaanyihanaka, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />mena wiiya nhakhu aya. Nansho, ooniheke nrima woombone ni ukhulhuvelhiya, eechonihaka wo iphiro chonkhaye wiira meettuchiho a Nlhuku Moopolhi ihu phi o ikeekhene. <verse eid="TIT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Ukhalhawaya nnema wa Nlhuku uhopatakuliya, wiira ummwiihe noopo wa attu onkhaye. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Nnema wa Nlhuku unoniittuchiha hii wiira nikhote nikakata no velhaponi va, nihikhalhe attu o uhapalhiya, nikhalhe wo wiitimarikha ni wo uvarechesha ikekhiaye, uno ninthimichaka Nlhuku ninari bado velhaponi va, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />niwehereraka nihuku no mpuha ninokhulhuvelha ihu, vanohalha aya upatakulhiya nthimicho wa Nlhuku mulhupalhe ni Moopolhi ihu, Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Yoyo aheekumiha mwanene wo nlhatu wihu wiira anoopolhe mu uhilhokani mwonkhaye anihapihaka ukhalha atakatifu awe, attu anovarechesha upangacha chittu choombone.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Mwiittuchiheke chilha chittu chilha, nvarelhelhaka ikuru inyu uno mwaalheheraka ni waamuka attu anowiiwelhelhani. Ni vavawo hikhalhe ntu hinowiwelhelhani.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Makhalhelho a attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Mwoopusheke attu wiira yaathimicheke ahoolhelhi ni attu anotawara, yeewelhelheke ni ukhalha rata wo kila iphiro upangacha mitheko chonkhaye. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Mwaahimerieke wiira ahinruwane ntu riyoothe, nansho akhalheke attu o mpuha ni o wiiwanana. Ni wo mahuku onkhaye yooniheke nrima woombone wa kila ntu. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Ukhalhawaya khalhayi vawo hii naari attu o uhikhalha ni irusho, o tiyamaru, ni attu o uwonya. Naari ipotta cho nikakata no wiipuhiha no kila iphiro. Nikhalhaka mu uwonyani ni ihache, attu anivengaka ni hii nivenganaka naashineneru.<verse eid="TIT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Nansho ikatema yo mpuha ni uttuna wa Nlhuku Moopolhi ihu vaapatakulhiye aya, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />ahonoopolha, kuhiwe wo nlhatu uriyoothe wo ikekhiaye waapannge ihu hii, nansho wo ikiriri awe, ni wo iphiro yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku nonivahera wiira niyarie tho ni univaha ukumi wo naanano wo unihapiha mmaashini. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Nlhuku ahonivaha wo winchiva Iphumu awe wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo Moopolhi ihu, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />wiira etu wo nnema wa Nlhuku naalhakelhiye ikekhiaye, niwe naapatta ukumi wo uhimalha unokhulhuvelha ihu. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Nna phi nuulhumo no ukhulhuvelhiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Kinouthananani inyuva nvarecheshe ulha mwaha ulha, wiira attu onkhaye anonrumelhelha Nlhuku akhalheke ni nrima wo upanga chittu choombone, chinaatelhiha attu mirima. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Nansho nshembeke malhove o uvaanyihana o uhikhalha ni maana anaacha manyaapwiiya, indewo ni uvaanyihana mwaha unaacha Malhehero. Ukhalhawaya yayo khanlhoka ni mena kharina maana ariyoothe. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Ntu naaniha attu yoyo mmwamukeke nkwaha wo upacha ni nkwaha wo nayelhi, aahiiweke mummwalhaaneke, <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />nchuwelhaka wiira ntu thoko yoyo hopotera ni uwonya. Ukhalhawaya uwonya wawe phi nonhukumulha wiira howonya.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhove o umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Vanohalha aka waaruma Nartema ama Natikiko, mwaavieke iphiro yo uwa Unikopoli mmwe naakumaana, ukhalhawaya kiholhakelha uwa ukhalhani wowo nlhaalha wo uririya. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Mpangeke kila chinohalha inyu wooria, waakaviha ashinna Zeno owiittuchiha Malhehero ni Naapolo, wiira vaneeta aya munkwahani mwaya, ahiwukuwelhiye ittu iriyoothe. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Attu ihu ni ayo lazima vano eettucheke upanga mitheko choombone, wiira chaakavihere wimma maphepu ittu ni upatta yo waavaha attu anovekelha, ukumi waya ukhalhe wo urera.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Attu onkhaye anaakhalhana aka va, anouvahani isalamu. Ni isalamu chihu mwaapiihereke manyampwana anaattuna ihu anonrumelhelha Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Nnema wa Nlhuku ukhalhe vamoka ni inyu mwaatti.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>